      "regularization-preserving duplicate-feature control",
      "deterministically shuffled target/evidence control",
      "hidden-label leakage sentinel",
      "byte-identical independent rerun"
    ],
    "promotion": "Authorize feature-based signed action only for at least 0.15 pooled RMSE gain, at least 0.05 gain over the best training-fold-mean action, wins on at least four repeated maps, bounded p90 and worst-5% tail changes, material datum sign accuracy at least 0.56, datum correlation at least 0.15, positive spatial-stress gain, and passing controls. Promote risk evidence separately only when risk Spearman is at least 0.20 and AUC at least 0.62 on at least four maps with positive spatial-stress Spearman.",
